ring practice yard~
A twenty-foot circle like the others, but chalked twice over and scuffed
into a shallow bowl by generations of feet.  Step into it and you are in
the training yard, alone with the dummy.  HELP DUMMY explains the rest.
~

#0

#ROOMS
#2419
The Training Yard~
A square of hard-packed earth behind the Grand Knight's sparring room,
walled on every side, with room in it for one fighter at a time.  A dummy
stands at the centre on a weighted post, leaning slightly, sackcloth split
and resewn along every seam.  Somebody has chalked a tally on the wall and
given up counting.

Nothing dies here.  That is the whole point of the place.  The practice
ring is underfoot where you came through it; LEAVE RING steps back out,
and HELP DUMMY explains everything the yard can tell you.
~
0 LV 1
E
ring practice~
The ring you came in by, scuffed into the earth.  LEAVE RING takes you
back to the sparring room.
~
E
dummy post tally~
The tally runs to four figures before the chalk gives out.  Underneath,
in a different hand: DUMMY sets it up, DUMMY REPORT tells you how you
did, LEAVE RING gets you out.
~
